Package: cubie-a7z-fanctl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: temperature based PWM fan controller for Cubie A7Z
 Controls a Linux hwmon PWM fan using CPU or SoC temperatures, with
 automatic device rediscovery and configurable fail-safe fan speeds.
